<title>UK: Ex-dividends take 8.17 points off UK's FTSE index.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends take 8.17 points off UK's FTSE index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>FTSE International Ltd said the following FTSE 100 index stocks trading ex-dividend on Monday will take 8.17 points off the index today.</p>
<p>						  DIVIDEND     INDEX</p>
<p>						  (PENCE)     EFFECT</p>
<p>		  COMPANY		    Net   Gross  Gross</p>
<p>* BTR					  4.00   5.00  1.147</p>
<p>* British Aerospace			6.25   7.81  0.196</p>
<p>* Ladbroke Group			   2.40   3.00  0.205</p>
<p>* Legal &amp; General Group		  8.75  10.94  0.316</p>
<p>* Peninsular &amp; Oriental Steam Nav   13.50  16.88  0.597</p>
<p>* Prudential Corporation		 5.80   7.25  0.811</p>
<p>* RTZ Corporation			  8.48  10.60  0.661</p>
<p>* Shell Trading &amp; Transport	   14.40  18.00  3.480</p>
<p>* Tesco					3.25   4.06  0.512</p>
<p>* Williams Holdings			5.80   7.25  0.246</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7954</p>
</text>
